{"schema_version":1,"id":"d59f2nfoagoz","type":"work","title":"通惠河志","authors":[{"name":"吳仲","role":"撰","dynasty":"明","entity_id":"hixhd2h9bekl"}],"indexed_by":[{"source":"欽定四庫全書總目","source_bid":"d59dh3vo9af4","title_info":"《通惠河志》•二卷、《附錄》•一卷","author_info":"明吳仲撰","summary":"明吳仲撰。仲字亞甫，武進人。正德丁丑進士，官至處州府知府。通惠河即元郭守敬所開通州運河，明初湮廢，糧皆由陸以運，費重民勞。仲以御史巡按直隸，疏請重浚。不數月工成，遂至今為永利。其事詳見《明史》。後仲外調處州時，恐久而其法浸弛，故於舟中撰此書奏進，得旨刊行。上卷載閘壩建置開浚事宜，而冠以源委圖說，中卷及附錄皆諸司奏疏，下卷皆碑記詩章也。","edition":"兩淮馬裕家藏本"},{"source":"續修四庫全書","source_bid":"d59f2og4vksh","title_info":"《通惠河志》二卷","author_info":"明吳仲撰","summary":"《通惠河志》二卷。明吳仲撰。影印南京圖書館藏明嘉靖刻隆慶增修本。","edition":"影印南京圖書館藏明嘉靖刻隆慶增修本","volume":"第850冊","section":"史部 史部"},{"source":"四庫全書存目叢書","source_bid":"d59f2og4vke9","title_info":"《通惠河志》二卷","author_info":"明吳仲撰","summary":"《通惠河志》二卷。明吳仲撰。民國三十年輯玄覽堂叢書影印明隆慶刻本。","edition":"民國三十年輯玄覽堂叢書影印明隆慶刻本","volume":"第221冊","section":"史部"}],"juan_count":{"number":2},"additional_works":[{"book_title":"附錄","n_juan":1}],"resources":[{"id":"shidianguji-keben","name":"识典古籍","url":"https://www.shidianguji.com/book/CADAL02051960","metadata":{"edition":"刻本","version":"v9","total_page":205,"paragraph_count":183,"check_type":"粗校"},"types":["text","image"]},{"id":"shidianguji-jiajingkelongqingzen","name":"识典古籍","url":"https://www.shidianguji.com/book/CADAL02089638","metadata":{"edition":"嘉靖刻隆慶增修本","version":"v4","total_page":203,"paragraph_count":1347,"check_type":"AI整理"},"types":["text","image"]},{"name":"Internet Archive","id":"internet-archive","url":"https://archive.org/details/02089638.cn","types":["image"]},{"id":"wikimedia-commons-xuxiu","name":"維基共享 續修四庫全書 PDF","short_name":"維基共享","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E7%BA%8C%E4%BF%AE%E5%9B%9B%E5%BA%AB%E5%85%A8%E6%9B%B8%E7%AC%AC0850%E5%86%8A.pdf","metadata":{"volume":850},"types":["image"]},{"name":"维基共享资源","type":"image","id":"commons","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E9%80%9A%E6%83%A0%E6%B2%B3%E5%BF%97.djvu"}],"measures":[{"unit":"卷","number":2}],"measure_info":"二卷","upd